  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "レッドヘッドは　からみせいぶんをほのおエネルギーに　かえげきからの　かえんほうしゃを　まきちらす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "레드 헤드가 매운 성분을 불꽃 에너지로 변환시켜 불같이 매운 화염방사를 사방에 흩뿌린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會把辣味成分轉換成火之能量，然後從紅色的頭朝著四周噴灑出辣到爆炸的火焰。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa tête rouge convertit la substance piquante produite par son corps en énergie de type Feu et crache des flammes brûlantes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein roter Kopf wandelt Scharfstoffe in Feuer- Energie um und kann so feurig scharfe Flammen von sich geben.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La cabeza roja transforma los capsaicinoides de su cuerpo en energía flamígera, lo que le permite arrojar llamaradas extremadamente abrasadoras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La testa rossa trasforma le proprie sostanze pungenti in energia Fuoco che usa per lanciare fiammate superpiccanti.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The red head converts spicy chemicals into fire energy and blasts the surrounding area with a super spicy stream of flame.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "レッドヘッドは　辛み成分を炎エネルギーに　変え激辛の　火炎放射を　まき散らす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "把辣味成分转换成火之能量，然后从红色的头朝四周发射出辣到爆炸的火焰。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La cabeza roja transforma los capsaicinoides de su cuerpo en energía flamígera, lo que le permite arrojar llamaradas extremadamente abrasadoras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "グリーンヘッドは　からみせいぶんにのうが　しげきされて　きょうぼうか。あばれだすと　てがつけられない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "그린 헤드는 매운 성분에 뇌를 자극받아 흉포해졌다. 날뛰기 시작하면 손쓸 도리가 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "綠色的頭因為腦部受到了辣味成分的刺激而變得凶暴。一旦暴怒起來就會一發不可收拾。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa tête verte est agressive à cause des substances épicées qui stimulent son cerveau. Quand elle s’énerve, rien ne peut l’arrêter.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der grüne Kopf hat eine brutale Veranlagung, da Scharfstoffe sein Gehirn stimulieren. Wütet er erst einmal, ist er nicht mehr aufzuhalten.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La cabeza verde es mucho más despiadada por el efecto de los capsaicinoides sobre su cerebro. Cuando enloquece, no hay forma de detenerla.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le sue sostanze piccanti influiscono sul cervello della testa verde, rendendola feroce. Quando va fuori di senno, non c’è modo di fermarla.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The green head has turned vicious due to the spicy chemicals stimulating its brain. Once it goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "グリーンヘッドは　辛み成分に脳が　刺激されて　凶暴化。暴れだすと　手がつけられない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "绿色的头会变得凶暴，是因为脑部受到了辣味成分的刺激。一旦暴怒起来就会一发不可收拾。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La cabeza verde es mucho más despiadada por el efecto de los capsaicinoides sobre su cerebro. Cuando enloquece, no hay forma de detenerla.",
      "language": {
